{"ts":"2026-08-10T06:23:17.498Z","author":"claude","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"507208966ab0dc1f88c5707f","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"topic":null},"op":"update","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-10T06:23:17.498Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/resolution","value":"fixed"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A failed IndexedDB read is reported as a failure so queued mutations are never treated as drained or replayed"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"getQueuedMutations returns a discriminated QueueReadResult; the initial read failure aborts the flush and a post-replay read failure posts MUTATIONS_PARTIAL carrying the known replayed count. Reverting the fix fails 2 of the 6 sw-queue tests"}],"before_hash":"352a6b206c77e01a3c23569cb7b5985d5b2a465798832f3a81582b9317d5a929","after_hash":"4cea5aa6efb9844ca4caaab197cdac5bcdffd760d72081dad1d6160189d67f63","message":"Record the resolution fields the close policy requires"}
{"ts":"2026-08-10T06:23:17.927Z","author":"claude","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"507208966ab0dc1f88c5707f","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"topic":null},"op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-08-10T06:23:17.927Z","author":"claude","text":"CodeRabbit caught that the item described itself as fixed while its status stayed open, and separately that the partial-replay test could not verify the replayed count because fetch rejected so nothing ever replayed. The second was the substantive one: the test asserted MUTATIONS_PARTIAL but replayed was always zero, and its only assertion was a loop over posted messages that would also have passed had no message been posted at all."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-10T06:23:17.927Z"}],"before_hash":"4cea5aa6efb9844ca4caaab197cdac5bcdffd760d72081dad1d6160189d67f63","after_hash":"86b0661f1d15fe71357ea604b68e1afe9729007faa7a0427d07563b0974dfffb"}
